WEBVTT

00:03.200 --> 00:06.917
We will now begin the 57th
expedition beyond the walls!

00:07.900 --> 00:10.125
Onward!

00:14.290 --> 00:17.990
We believe that in the basement of
Eren Jaeger's Zhiganshina home,

00:17.990 --> 00:20.057
there are answers about the Titans
that he himself doesn't have.

00:22.120 --> 00:23.838
We will head there.

00:24.830 --> 00:26.964
You new recruits will be here.

00:27.020 --> 00:28.650
You'll be between the cart guard team

00:28.650 --> 00:30.554
and the recon support team.

00:30.950 --> 00:34.347
Your job will be to ride alongside the
spare horses and relay messages.

00:34.550 --> 00:37.560
The Special Operations
Squad will be here.

00:37.560 --> 00:39.195
Standing by in the center
of the last ranks.

00:39.760 --> 00:43.324
It's the safest place in the formation.

00:43.349 --> 00:45.860
Special ops will be here.

00:57.740 --> 00:58.780
That's no Aberrant.

00:59.390 --> 01:00.870
It's intelligent!

01:01.450 --> 01:04.290
Like the Armored or Colossal
Titans, or Eren...

01:04.800 --> 01:06.960
A human in the body of a Titan!

01:10.150 --> 01:12.550
Its movements are much more
precise than the others' are!

01:12.970 --> 01:13.820
Damn it.

01:13.820 --> 01:14.860
I...

01:14.860 --> 01:16.380
I underestimated it!

01:18.730 --> 01:20.260
It protected its neck...

01:20.530 --> 01:22.510
Damn it! I can't get away!

01:22.510 --> 01:23.500
Jean!

01:23.500 --> 01:26.250
Avenge the bastard who
rushed to his death!

01:27.950 --> 01:29.400
It stopped?

01:29.960 --> 01:30.990
That's the one...

01:30.990 --> 01:32.740
That's the one that killed him!

01:32.740 --> 01:35.560
He rushed to his death
on the right flank!

01:35.560 --> 01:37.960
Avenge him!

01:52.820 --> 01:55.290
We've bought enough time, right?

01:55.290 --> 01:57.090
Let's get the hell away from it!

01:58.760 --> 02:00.730
No... Why?

02:01.310 --> 02:02.360
Is it

02:03.679 --> 02:05.319
heading toward Eren?

03:32.926 --> 03:36.043
Sync and corrections by masaca
- addic7ed.com -

03:36.980 --> 03:41.990
Forest of Giant Trees
57th Expedition Beyond the Walls (2)

03:49.370 --> 03:52.210
How's your 3D Maneuver Gear looking, Armin?

03:52.970 --> 03:54.170
It's okay...

03:54.170 --> 03:57.710
The clasp released as intended,
so it seems it's not broken.

03:58.380 --> 03:59.380
I see...

03:59.380 --> 04:00.630
I'm glad to hear it.

04:01.090 --> 04:02.880
But what do we do?

04:02.880 --> 04:04.720
We only have one horse.

04:05.970 --> 04:09.390
If Jean's horse comes back,
the three of us can move, but...

04:10.480 --> 04:12.270
Damn it, why?

04:12.840 --> 04:17.780
Reiner's horse returned, so why didn't mine?

04:21.400 --> 04:25.290
We can't stay here any longer.

04:27.450 --> 04:30.620
In the worst case, we'll have
to leave someone here...

04:31.160 --> 04:34.210
But how would we decide who to leave?

04:35.000 --> 04:36.420
Armin, since he's wounded?

04:37.420 --> 04:40.250
Reiner, since he's big and would have
trouble riding with someone else?

04:41.300 --> 04:44.680
Or should I run and try to find my horse?

04:47.090 --> 04:48.260
Damn it!

04:48.260 --> 04:51.220
Why the hell do I have to think about this?!

04:51.680 --> 04:54.220
We all made it through that fight alive.

04:54.220 --> 04:56.560
This isn't fair...

05:13.580 --> 05:14.410
Armin...

05:16.210 --> 05:17.040
Hey, Armin!

05:19.000 --> 05:21.360
Are you still out of it?

05:21.950 --> 05:25.130
Yeah, my head's still a bit fuzzy...

05:25.510 --> 05:26.510
I see...

05:26.800 --> 05:28.970
But we must decide.

05:29.470 --> 05:33.350
It's a hard choice, but someone
will have to stay behind.

05:36.450 --> 05:37.440
Wait!

05:38.280 --> 05:40.860
First, let's fire a smoke round...

05:40.860 --> 05:42.900
If the formation continued straight ahead,

05:42.900 --> 05:45.650
the row 4-3 team should be nearby.

05:51.450 --> 05:53.950
That's the signal for an emergency...

05:53.950 --> 05:57.190
But I can't imagine they'll understand
our intentions just from that.

05:57.670 --> 05:59.830
Armin, we can wait another three minutes.

06:00.440 --> 06:02.750
By then, we must decide—

06:02.750 --> 06:03.750
I'll stay.

06:05.050 --> 06:09.550
But there's something I want
you to tell them for me...

06:10.220 --> 06:12.180
Preferably to Commander Erwin alone—

06:12.180 --> 06:13.470
No, Armin.

06:13.930 --> 06:16.100
You should tell him yourself.

06:16.810 --> 06:18.310
Looks like someone's here...

06:18.770 --> 06:21.230
And with two horses!

06:23.860 --> 06:25.150
That's...

06:27.650 --> 06:28.820
Krista!

06:29.450 --> 06:31.660
Is everyone okay?

06:35.450 --> 06:37.290
That's my horse...

06:37.910 --> 06:38.790
Whoa, whoa.

06:38.790 --> 06:40.470
Calm down, Buchwald.

06:41.010 --> 06:44.410
He ran toward me, terrified...

06:45.340 --> 06:46.590
Did you engage the Titans?

06:47.550 --> 06:50.380
Armin, what happened to you?

06:50.380 --> 06:51.510
Are you okay?

06:51.510 --> 06:52.850
Yeah, I think so.

06:54.630 --> 06:57.430
I can't believe that smoke
round brought you here.

06:58.020 --> 07:01.350
I was nearby, and I already had Jean's horse.

07:01.690 --> 07:03.860
Even horses like you.

07:03.860 --> 07:05.860
It seems you have a strange charisma.

07:06.210 --> 07:07.360
You saved our lives.

07:08.650 --> 07:10.150
But I'm so glad

07:11.200 --> 07:14.160
that the worst didn't happen to you.

07:15.080 --> 07:16.450
I really am glad.

07:22.120 --> 07:23.170
God...

07:23.170 --> 07:24.400
A goddess.

07:25.500 --> 07:26.690
I want to marry her.

07:27.810 --> 07:30.510
Well, we should rejoin the
formation as soon as possible.

07:30.510 --> 07:33.470
Yeah, there should be orders to retreat.

07:36.470 --> 07:40.680
To think we've been pushed back,
less than an hour out of the walls.

07:40.680 --> 07:43.150
Things are even bleaker
than I'd imagined...

07:43.380 --> 07:44.640
And for some reason,

07:44.640 --> 07:48.110
it went in the opposite direction from
the vanguard command team...

07:48.110 --> 07:49.070
It?

07:52.110 --> 07:53.600
A green round?

07:54.140 --> 07:56.280
Looks like they're continuing the operation,

07:56.280 --> 07:57.990
only changing course...

07:58.620 --> 07:59.520
What?

07:59.520 --> 08:01.330
That wasn't a retreat command?

08:01.330 --> 08:03.920
What is Commander Erwin thinking?

08:04.250 --> 08:07.750
In theory, any soldier has
the authority to determine

08:07.750 --> 08:09.720
when mission completion
is no longer possible.

08:10.270 --> 08:13.380
Did command not see our
smoke round somehow?

08:13.380 --> 08:14.620
Even if we don't know what's going on,

08:14.620 --> 08:17.010
there's still only one thing for us to do...

08:17.470 --> 08:18.910
Follow the order!

08:26.310 --> 08:27.400
Smoke round.

08:27.770 --> 08:28.900
Green.

08:29.270 --> 08:31.150
Oluo, you fire it.

08:31.530 --> 08:32.570
Roger.

08:33.350 --> 08:36.030
For now, everything seems to be going fine.

08:37.640 --> 08:40.630
But is it really?

08:41.200 --> 08:44.250
We may already have casualties
on the front lines.

08:44.250 --> 08:45.290
Reporting!

08:46.080 --> 08:47.290
Message to pass along!

08:47.580 --> 08:49.630
Right flank recon has been destroyed!

08:50.200 --> 08:52.170
Our recon system is partially inoperative.

08:52.170 --> 08:54.550
Pass this on, to the left.

08:55.760 --> 08:57.300
Did you hear that, Petra?

08:57.720 --> 08:58.600
Go.

08:58.600 --> 08:59.560
Yes, Captain.

09:01.270 --> 09:02.560
The right flank?!

09:03.270 --> 09:05.350
I think that's where Armin is.

09:05.980 --> 09:11.170
But Armin and the others should still
be in position, near the center.

09:11.170 --> 09:13.520
The Titans can't have made it in that far...

09:15.470 --> 09:16.860
A black round?

09:17.170 --> 09:18.700
Aberrants?

09:18.870 --> 09:20.990
Eren, you fire it.

09:20.990 --> 09:22.320
R-Right!

09:22.640 --> 09:24.410
What a mess.

09:24.940 --> 09:28.330
We let it penetrate deep into our formation.

09:30.210 --> 09:31.800
It's almost here...

09:31.800 --> 09:33.170
The Titan.

09:33.570 --> 09:38.260
Beneath those smoke rounds,
is there someone fighting?

09:50.820 --> 09:51.770
Damn it...

09:52.150 --> 09:53.570
Look over here.

09:54.610 --> 09:56.860
You monster...

10:00.660 --> 10:01.580
Now!

10:10.130 --> 10:11.810
Three separate attacks at once...

10:11.810 --> 10:15.590
You're pretty smart, but you can't
possibly protect all three targets!

10:16.130 --> 10:17.550
Spine, Achilles tendon...

10:17.550 --> 10:18.880
It doesn't matter!

10:18.880 --> 10:20.970
Hit one, and we will slow it down...

10:21.350 --> 10:22.640
Go!

10:24.430 --> 10:26.060
Damn you for causing so many deaths!

10:26.310 --> 10:28.060
We'll make you die a slow, painful death!

10:34.500 --> 10:35.610
It jumped?

10:49.540 --> 10:51.580
L-Let me go!

11:20.860 --> 11:24.200
The most important thing is
to ensure they hear of this...

11:24.590 --> 11:26.580
I must tell them what we're up against!

11:33.880 --> 11:35.090
An Aberrant?!

11:35.420 --> 11:36.840
It got in all the way here?

11:37.170 --> 11:38.290
We'll take it out!

11:38.290 --> 11:40.670
We can't let it penetrate any farther!

11:57.100 --> 11:59.740
The right flank's been wiped out?

11:59.740 --> 12:01.350
But we aren't withdrawing?

12:01.380 --> 12:02.240
Why?!

12:02.240 --> 12:03.490
No idea...

12:03.490 --> 12:04.950
The Commander's orders...

12:04.950 --> 12:06.780
Just relay the message to the left!

12:15.790 --> 12:17.090
What's going on?

12:17.710 --> 12:20.210
We keep heading east.

12:21.220 --> 12:24.090
Our goal is supposed to
be south, to the old city.

12:24.600 --> 12:26.409
Right now, our formation's

12:26.434 --> 12:28.010
on a collision course.

12:28.010 --> 12:28.850
Yeah.

12:29.350 --> 12:30.680
You can see it...

12:31.430 --> 12:33.069
The forest of giant trees!

12:39.320 --> 12:41.570
Seems Titans passed through here.

12:44.030 --> 12:46.160
There's nothing growing on the road.

12:50.450 --> 12:52.210
We can bring the carts through, too.

12:53.750 --> 12:55.280
Send word to the rear

12:55.900 --> 12:59.630
that only the central cart guard
should enter the forest.

12:59.630 --> 13:00.590
Yes, sir!

13:15.230 --> 13:17.010
Excuse me, sir...

13:17.010 --> 13:20.470
The center row appears to
be entering the forest,

13:20.470 --> 13:23.590
but wouldn't the rest of
us collide with the forest?

13:25.200 --> 13:26.280
We're going around.

13:27.400 --> 13:28.100
Yes, sir!

13:31.620 --> 13:35.460
Hey, what are we doing at this tourist spot?

13:35.830 --> 13:40.170
We're totally off from both our original
destination and our return point.

13:40.800 --> 13:41.960
I don't know...

13:42.800 --> 13:45.890
I don't know, but the order came from
Commander Erwin, after all.

13:46.220 --> 13:48.600
He must have a plan.

13:49.060 --> 13:50.930
What kind of plan?

13:51.520 --> 13:53.480
Are they planning to hold a welcome ceremony

13:53.480 --> 13:55.760
for us new recruits at a tourist spot?

13:55.760 --> 13:58.310
No, I don't think so.

13:58.310 --> 13:59.440
That was a joke.

14:00.190 --> 14:03.530
Anyway, that giant woman's following us.

14:04.030 --> 14:08.200
No matter what his plan, we can't stay here.

14:09.050 --> 14:10.370
The only thing I can imagine

14:10.370 --> 14:13.330
is that we're passing through
on our way to somewhere else...

14:13.750 --> 14:15.330
Everyone, halt!

14:18.920 --> 14:21.550
All right. Listen up, recruits.

14:22.040 --> 14:24.550
We will now make preparations
to launch a counterattack.

14:24.550 --> 14:26.550
Draw your blades, and wait above in the trees.

14:26.910 --> 14:30.550
If any Titans try to enter this forest,
stop them at all costs!

14:30.850 --> 14:34.120
U-Um, Sir, what do you—

14:34.120 --> 14:35.730
Shut up and follow orders!

14:40.310 --> 14:41.800
Seriously?

14:41.800 --> 14:43.400
What's going on?

14:47.660 --> 14:52.580
H-Hey, it looks like only the center
line went into the woods.

14:52.580 --> 14:54.090
What happened to the formation?

14:54.660 --> 14:56.250
It's gone.

14:56.910 --> 14:59.700
The forest blocks our advance,
so the left and right flanks

14:59.700 --> 15:01.840
will have to skirt the forest.

15:02.290 --> 15:04.340
We've lost our recon ability.

15:05.460 --> 15:08.340
Why didn't we change course
to avoid this forest?

15:08.800 --> 15:11.510
Did Commander Erwin read the map wrong?

15:12.180 --> 15:13.380
I don't know...

15:13.800 --> 15:16.640
Perhaps we tried too hard to avoid the threat

15:16.640 --> 15:20.220
on the right flank and ended up here...

15:28.820 --> 15:30.780
This is insane...

15:32.030 --> 15:35.290
We've abandoned the original
mission to cache supplies.

15:36.120 --> 15:39.330
And when we abandoned it,
we should've turned tail and run...

15:39.870 --> 15:42.540
But instead, we're forging
ahead to a tourist trap.

15:43.540 --> 15:45.920
And now, we're just standing here,

15:46.340 --> 15:48.760
to stop any Titans that enter the woods?

15:52.220 --> 15:56.100
Damn him for giving a crazy order.

15:56.470 --> 15:57.890
He'll hear you...

15:57.890 --> 16:01.730
And this no real explanation
thing is innovative, too.

16:01.730 --> 16:05.780
Of course, I'm sure he has his own concerns...

16:06.110 --> 16:07.110
What do you mean?

16:07.440 --> 16:12.050
A commander deemed worthless
by his men in a critical situation

16:12.050 --> 16:15.990
quite often succumbs to a
mysterious attack from behind.

16:16.290 --> 16:19.120
I'm just saying it wouldn't surprise me.

16:20.080 --> 16:22.380
Jean, so what are you going to do?

16:23.380 --> 16:25.000
Don't be so serious...

16:25.590 --> 16:28.130
This situation's got me a
bit worked up, that's all.

16:28.840 --> 16:30.730
What am I going to do?

16:31.430 --> 16:35.430
Obey my orders, and keep
Titans out of the forest.

16:37.060 --> 16:40.430
You also think it's the right move, don't you?

16:40.640 --> 16:41.390
Ah—

16:42.200 --> 16:44.190
You look like you know something.

16:44.810 --> 16:46.190
Well...

16:47.540 --> 16:49.310
Five-meter class incoming!

16:56.070 --> 16:59.340
Why bring the formation here?

17:00.040 --> 17:03.420
What is Commander Erwin thinking?

17:04.170 --> 17:07.920
No, that isn't what
we should think about.

17:08.550 --> 17:11.010
The Female Titan is pursuing Eren.

17:11.470 --> 17:13.930
And the Commander knows that.

17:14.430 --> 17:17.930
Assume those two things,
and see what you can deduce...

17:19.310 --> 17:20.220
Captain...

17:20.600 --> 17:21.850
Captain Levi!

17:22.440 --> 17:23.390
What?

17:23.980 --> 17:25.150
Well...

17:25.150 --> 17:26.710
We're in the middle of the woods!

17:27.360 --> 17:29.940
If the center enters alone,

17:29.940 --> 17:31.990
we won't know if Titans are approaching!

17:32.450 --> 17:34.530
It seems something's approaching '
us from the right...

17:35.070 --> 17:38.830
How are we supposed to dodge
the Titans or protect the carts?

17:39.160 --> 17:41.750
Don't go on and on about the obvious...

17:42.300 --> 17:44.420
We can't do that anymore, of course.

17:45.290 --> 17:47.080
Th-Then why?

17:47.420 --> 17:49.250
Look around, Eren...

17:49.670 --> 17:51.840
At all these big-ass trees.

17:54.260 --> 17:58.050
It's the perfect environment
for 3D Maneuver Gear.

17:59.060 --> 18:03.500
And try to use that tiny brain of yours...

18:03.960 --> 18:06.690
If you don't want to die, think.

18:07.190 --> 18:08.310
Yes, sir!

18:09.440 --> 18:10.610
I see.

18:11.130 --> 18:14.420
I just can't keep up right now
because I'm still new.

18:15.070 --> 18:17.480
He won't just tell me the answer.

18:17.480 --> 18:19.860
I have to figure it out for myself.

18:20.620 --> 18:24.290
I'm sure that's how they all learned to fight.

18:26.330 --> 18:27.810
What the hell?

18:27.810 --> 18:29.380
Seriously?

18:29.380 --> 18:33.380
Damn it all... What the hell is going on here?

18:36.180 --> 18:37.260
Wait!

18:37.930 --> 18:43.030
Wait a minute... No one knows
what's really going on?

18:44.140 --> 18:47.970
Maybe not even Captain Levi?

18:49.810 --> 18:51.940
The Female Titan is after Eren...

18:52.570 --> 18:54.570
If I'm right about that,

18:54.570 --> 18:56.780
then there's only one reason to come here.

18:57.950 --> 19:01.620
This is where Commander Erwin intends
to deal with the Female Titan...

19:01.620 --> 19:02.660
Armin...

19:03.770 --> 19:08.710
Our orders were to keep the
Titans out of the forest, right?

19:10.970 --> 19:11.920
In other words...

19:12.630 --> 19:15.720
There's no longer any reason to fight...

19:16.790 --> 19:18.010
Right?

19:52.130 --> 19:53.340
A black smoke round?

19:53.340 --> 19:54.960
It's from directly behind us!

19:55.220 --> 19:57.640
It's whatever was coming
toward us on the right.

19:58.300 --> 19:59.800
Draw your blades.

20:03.260 --> 20:07.560
If we see it, it'll only be for a second.

20:31.750 --> 20:32.660
Go!

20:47.580 --> 20:48.640
It's fast!

20:48.640 --> 20:51.640
In these trees, there's no way to
foresee and evade its attacks!

20:51.640 --> 20:52.690
It'll catch us!

20:52.900 --> 20:54.860
Captain, let's switch to Maneuver Gear!

20:55.520 --> 20:56.520
Captain!

20:58.940 --> 21:00.360
You won't escape!

21:00.950 --> 21:02.360
Reinforcements from the rear!

21:18.210 --> 21:20.260
Captain, your orders?!

21:20.460 --> 21:21.510
Let's go for it!

21:21.510 --> 21:22.760
It's dangerous...

21:23.260 --> 21:25.180
We should kill it!

21:26.470 --> 21:28.310
I'll rip you apart!

21:30.390 --> 21:33.480
Fool, you've run straight into hell.

21:33.870 --> 21:37.640
You're chasing a group of master
Titan killers!

21:40.420 --> 21:41.710
Captain Levi?

21:42.680 --> 21:43.860
Captain!

21:44.140 --> 21:45.470
Give us your orders.

21:45.470 --> 21:47.680
At this rate, it will catch up with us!

21:47.680 --> 21:49.130
We kill it here...

21:49.130 --> 21:51.070
That's why we came to this forest!

21:51.070 --> 21:53.000
Right, Captain?

21:53.000 --> 21:55.040
Captain, your orders!

21:58.280 --> 22:00.500
Everyone, cover your ears.

22:05.693 --> 22:09.483
Sync and corrections by
- addic7ed.com -
